@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8082
@orderId = OPEN-RUSH-DEMO-001
@paymentKey = PK-{{orderId}}

### 결제 승인 (새 결제를 만들려면 orderId를 변경)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{orderId}}

{
  "paymentKey": "{{paymentKey}}",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "amount": 15000
}

### 주문 ID로 승인 결과 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments/orders/{{orderId}}
